{"4297470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Demon Fish Dead Ahead", "steam_appid": 4297470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297470/extras/f5d73fcc5529e7b7c1da8f63ca9dcd2d.poster.avif?t=1776570413\" width=874 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297470/extras/f5d73fcc5529e7b7c1da8f63ca9dcd2d.webm?t=1776570413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297470/extras/f5d73fcc5529e7b7c1da8f63ca9dcd2d.mp4?t=1776570413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon Fish Dead Ahead</strong> is a classic style <strong>turn-based JRPG</strong> that has taken inspiration from retro RPG's distilling the genre to its core elements: combat; exploration; and progression. Strategize against and defeat varying demon fish encounters to capture them and level up, boosting your attack and defense, running when necessary. Use your map to navigate and explore to locate points of interest across 4 large worlds and battle the lord of each area.. TO THE DEATH!<br><br>A simplified story and mechanics prevents players from feeling lost after  returning from a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 enemy types with <strong>unique 8-bit art!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 <strong>immense worlds</strong> containing 28 points of interest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworld map mechanic prevents getting lost!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack of  <strong>30 8-bit Chiptunes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplified combat mechanics and gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character leveling based on experience gained during battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and sweet story with <strong>cutscenes</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to pick up and play, never feeling lost, even after time away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish box allows you to track what you have caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 8 hours of playtime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic retro handheld gaming experience! This game runs on a <i>real</i> <strong>Game Boy Color</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>RPG Simplifications:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Equipment/Items/Inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only 3 combat options: Cast; Brace; Belay (Fight, Defend, Run)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No party members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Magic/MP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack/Defend skills based on experience level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal at save points only</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297470/extras/f5d73fcc5529e7b7c1da8f63ca9dcd2d.poster.avif?t=1776570413\" width=874 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297470/extras/f5d73fcc5529e7b7c1da8f63ca9dcd2d.webm?t=1776570413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297470/extras/f5d73fcc5529e7b7c1da8f63ca9dcd2d.mp4?t=1776570413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon Fish Dead Ahead</strong> is a classic style <strong>turn-based JRPG</strong> that has taken inspiration from retro RPG's distilling the genre to its core elements: combat; exploration; and progression. Strategize against and defeat varying demon fish encounters to capture them and level up, boosting your attack and defense, running when necessary. Use your map to navigate and explore to locate points of interest across 4 large worlds and battle the lord of each area.. TO THE DEATH!<br><br>A simplified story and mechanics prevents players from feeling lost after  returning from a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 enemy types with <strong>unique 8-bit art!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 <strong>immense worlds</strong> containing 28 points of interest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworld map mechanic prevents getting lost!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack of  <strong>30 8-bit Chiptunes!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplified combat mechanics and gameplay!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character leveling based on experience gained during battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and sweet story with <strong>cutscenes</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to pick up and play, never feeling lost, even after time away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish box allows you to track what you have caught!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 8 hours of playtime!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic retro handheld gaming experience! This game runs on a <i>real</i> <strong>Game Boy Color</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>RPG Simplifications:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Equipment/Items/Inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only 3 combat options: Cast; Brace; Belay (Fight, Defend, Run)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No party members</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Magic/MP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack/Defend skills based on experience level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal at save points only</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Sail the seas of hell while you catalog the local fauna in this turn-based classic JRPG, but watch out... SOMETHING LURKS BELOW!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297470/58ff7d139d2a2fded5be42818417910f8a86c558/header.jpg?t=1776570413", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297470/4f8429032e269875375ad8edd8a9cc569ec72ec7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776570413", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4297470/4f8429032e269875375ad8edd8a9cc569ec72ec7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776570413", "website": "https://rikoclon.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10/11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<stron